  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Onlookers identify an old man who takes in Zhan Bu Du as the city lord of Mountain Cliff City, and say Mountain Cliff City Lord is expected to visit their city to negotiate with their city lord.",
      "chapters": [
        1824
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "city-lord-named",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhan_bu_du",
        "char_mountain_cliff_city_lord"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Within Beast Calamity grotto-heaven, Mountain Cliff City is one of the ten most special cities. It stands at the top of a cliff at its highest point, surrounded by hard mountain rocks. The city is built of simple rocks and mud, with houses, walkways, gardens, fountains, city walls, and a City Lord statue at the center. The City Lord Manor is huge and tall, a city within a city, high enough to overlook the whole settlement. Bird faeces fertilize the hard rocky land for farming and draw merchant caravans to trade.",
      "chapters": [
        1853
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cliff-city-layout",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sacred Eagle City is much larger than Mountain Cliff City. Mountain Cliff City is only a sub-city, while Sacred Eagle City is one of the main cities.",
      "chapters": [
        1878
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sub-city-rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_sacred_eagle_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan annexes Beast Calamity grotto-heaven, he places Sacred Eagle City, Dark Valley, Spirit Spring Forest, Mountain Cliff City, and Star Collection City in Mini Western Desert, Mini Southern Border, Mini Central Continent, Mini Northern Plains, and Mini Blue Heaven respectively. On that list Mountain Cliff City sits in Mini Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        1919
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
